</a></div></div></div></header><main id="main" class="site-main clr"  role="main"><div id="content-wrap" class="container clr"><div id="primary" class="content-area clr"><div id="content" class="site-content clr"><div id="blog-entries" class="entries clr oceanwp-row blog-grid blog-equal-heights"><article id="post-8409" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-1 grid-entry post-8409 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="thumbnail"><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/3%e6%ad%a5%e9%a9%9f%e8%a7%a3%e6%b1%ba%e4%bd%a0%e6%8b%8d%e5%ad%90%e4%b8%8d%e7%a9%a9%e7%9a%84%e5%95%8f%e9%a1%8c/" class="thumbnail-link"><img width="300" height="169" src="https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/3步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題-300x169.png" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Read more about the article 3 步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題" itemprop="image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/3步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題-300x169.png 300w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/3步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題-600x338.png 600w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/3步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題-768x432.png 768w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/3步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題.png 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" title="3 步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題 1">			<span class="overlay"></span>
</a></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/3%e6%ad%a5%e9%a9%9f%e8%a7%a3%e6%b1%ba%e4%bd%a0%e6%8b%8d%e5%ad%90%e4%b8%8d%e7%a9%a9%e7%9a%84%e5%95%8f%e9%a1%8c/"  rel="bookmark">3 步驟解決你拍子不穩的問題</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
在教學的生涯裡，其實蠻常遇到學生有拍子上的問題。如果你意識到了自己有這樣拍子不穩的問題，卻始終不知道怎麼解決，節拍器開下去，怎麼努力要對拍子就是對不到，那麼你可以試試看以下三個步驟。如果你覺得自己的拍感本身就是不好，那麼試試先放著節拍器，然後讓身體對著拍子自然的律動</p></div></div></article><article id="post-8347" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-2 grid-entry post-8347 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 post_format-post-format-video entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="blog-entry-media thumbnail clr"><div class="blog-entry-video"><div class="responsive-video-wrap"><iframe title="Step By Step | #4 - Chinese New Year Song 拜年 - Blues Shuffle - Tab" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hryc1OurAUY?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/%e7%94%a81%e9%a6%96%e8%be%b2%e6%9b%86%e6%96%b0%e5%b9%b4%e6%9b%b2%e5%ad%b8%e7%bf%92%e8%97%8d%e8%aa%bfshuffle/"  rel="bookmark">用1首農曆新年曲學習藍調Shuffle</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
前幾年我曾經嘗試將農曆新年的經典曲「拜年」以藍調的Shuffle元素進行改編，並加入了藍調搖滾solo到曲子裡，得到不錯的迴響。如果有興趣學習的朋友，可以看看上面的「吉他帶動彈」影片，慢慢的跟著我的彈奏來學習，順便練一練藍調的Shuffle喔！</p></div></div></article><article id="post-8315" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-3 grid-entry post-8315 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 post_format-post-format-video entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="blog-entry-media thumbnail clr"><div class="blog-entry-video"><div class="responsive-video-wrap"><iframe title="Step By Step | #3 - White Christmas - Fingerstyle - Tab" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/p1K6tfqY4B4?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/%e5%b8%b6%e4%bd%a0%e5%bd%88%e5%a5%8f%e5%8f%b2%e4%b8%8a%e6%9c%80%e6%9a%a2%e9%8a%b7%e8%81%96%e8%aa%95%e6%ad%8c%e6%9b%b2-white-christmas/"  rel="bookmark">帶你彈奏史上最暢銷聖誕歌曲「White Christmas」</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
「史上最暢銷聖誕歌曲」這個標題，其實我一開始想到的是「Jingle Bell」，每年聖誕節不管走到哪裡都一定會聽到的歌，不就是應該也是最暢銷的嗎？原來這也是有分的，這首1942年出版，由Bing Crosby演唱的「White Christmas」其實是「世界最暢銷單曲」，嗯，維基百科是這樣寫的，也許這個紀錄是單指那個版本，在那個時間點</p></div></div></article><article id="post-8256" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-4 grid-entry post-8256 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 post_format-post-format-video entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="blog-entry-media thumbnail clr"><div class="blog-entry-video"><div class="responsive-video-wrap"><iframe title="Step By Step | #2 - &quot;Top Gun Anthem&quot; easily on the guitar - Fingerstyle - Tab" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/wpZbIWvM96c?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/%e5%be%9e%e6%8d%8d%e8%a1%9b%e6%88%b0%e5%a3%ab%e4%b8%bb%e9%a1%8c%e6%9b%b2%e5%ad%b8%e7%bf%922%e7%a8%ae%e6%9c%80%e9%81%a0%e8%bd%89%e8%aa%bf%e6%96%b9%e5%bc%8f/"  rel="bookmark">從「捍衛戰士」主題曲學習 2 種最遠轉調的方式</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
阿湯哥的經典成名電影「捍衛戰士」終於要出續集了！第一集中由知名吉他手Steve Stevens操刀的電吉他演奏，光是用聽的就可以感到壯盛激昂的澎湃感。這次筆者試著用簡易指彈的方式來進行改編，附上六線譜教大家彈奏，並介紹歌曲中２種最遠轉調 的方式！</p></div></div></article><article id="post-8016" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-5 grid-entry post-8016 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="thumbnail"><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/5%e5%80%8b%e5%9c%a8%e5%90%89%e4%bb%96%e4%b8%8a%e7%b7%b4%e7%bf%92%e6%a8%82%e5%8f%a5%e7%9a%84%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/" class="thumbnail-link"><img width="300" height="200" src="https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/guitar-2875377_1280-fix-e1568349769376-300x200.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Read more about the article 5 個在吉他上練習樂句的方法" itemprop="image" decoding="async" srcset="https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/guitar-2875377_1280-fix-e1568349769376-300x200.jpg 300w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/guitar-2875377_1280-fix-e1568349769376-768x511.jpg 768w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/guitar-2875377_1280-fix-e1568349769376-600x399.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" title="5 個在吉他上練習樂句的方法 2">			<span class="overlay"></span>
</a></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/5%e5%80%8b%e5%9c%a8%e5%90%89%e4%bb%96%e4%b8%8a%e7%b7%b4%e7%bf%92%e6%a8%82%e5%8f%a5%e7%9a%84%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/"  rel="bookmark">5 個在吉他上練習樂句的方法</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
這時候最直接的練習樂句方式就是照著範例彈奏，彈到滾瓜爛熟，不再出錯為止。於是乎，我們就可以結束這個範例練習，進行到下一個範例了。等等！如果你真的這樣就覺得已經練完，可以進到下一個範例的話，那就太浪費這個範例，嗯，應該說，浪費了這整本的教材。</p></div></div></article><article id="post-7860" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-6 grid-entry post-7860 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 tag-video post_format-post-format-video entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="blog-entry-media thumbnail clr"><div class="blog-entry-video"><div class="responsive-video-wrap"><iframe title="Step By Step | #1 - &quot;Smooth Criminal&quot; with strumming - Tab" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/s0OLHL3_358?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/%e8%ae%93%e5%88%b7%e6%89%a3%e6%8a%80%e5%b7%a7%e6%9b%b4%e9%80%b2%e9%9a%8e%e7%9a%843%e5%80%8b%e8%a6%81%e9%bb%9e/"  rel="bookmark">讓刷扣技巧更進階的 3 個要點</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
雖然我有提供譜給大家下載，但是我想有些彈奏重點光是透過看譜可能不會知道，所以最近我製作了一個影片，將彈奏動作放慢，並且將譜合成到影片中，讓有興趣練習刷扣的朋友可以對照著看，這樣應該比較有效率。</p></div></div></article><article id="post-2670" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-7 grid-entry post-2670 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail hentry category-creation category-distribution tag-19 tag-arrangement tag-composition post_format-post-format-video entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="blog-entry-media thumbnail clr"><div class="blog-entry-video"><div class="responsive-video-wrap"><iframe title="不拘時 - 妳還在嗎？[ 吉他演奏全創作單曲EP ]" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UjVdEezchws?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/are-you-still-there-%e5%90%89%e4%bb%96%e6%bc%94%e5%a5%8f%e5%96%ae%e6%9b%b2/"  rel="bookmark">📀 妳還在嗎？ ▸ 吉他演奏單曲</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/creation/" rel="category tag">創作</a><span class="owp-sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/creation/distribution/" rel="category tag">發行</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
繼2011首張全創作電/木吉他演奏專輯「島上無花」後，不拘時推出全新木吉他全創作演奏單曲「妳還在嗎？」，以木吉他為主要樂器，簡單的錄音和單純的四和絃變化來演奏出離人的思念，這次並邀請到口琴演奏家好友Otis來跨刀助陣，兩人合作更為此次單曲擦出不同火花，歡迎細細聆賞。</p></div></div></article><article id="post-2555" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-8 grid-entry post-2555 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail hentry category-creation category-full tag-arrangement tag-composition post_format-post-format-video entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="blog-entry-media thumbnail clr"><div class="blog-entry-video"><div class="responsive-video-wrap"><p class="responsive-video-wrap clr"><iframe title="旅行到城市的邊緣   個展" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/H-AxGSzfcX8?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe></p></div></div></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/cooperate-with-an-art-show/"  rel="bookmark">“旅行到城市的邊緣”個展 配樂合作</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/creation/" rel="category tag">創作</a><span class="owp-sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/creation/full/" rel="category tag">完整版音樂</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
第一次和畫展合作，製作了簡單溫暖的音樂來搭配這些帶給人溫暖的好畫作，而這些畫都出自於繪畫藝術家「野猴子」之筆。
下面的畫展影音最後有畫展的展出資訊，有興趣的朋友也可以去現場欣賞這些好畫作喔！</p></div></div></article><article id="post-2456" class="blog-entry clr col span_1_of_3 col-9 grid-entry post-2456 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-guitar tag-19 entry has-media"><div class="blog-entry-inner clr"><div class="thumbnail"><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/%e8%87%aa%e5%ad%b8%e5%90%89%e4%bb%96%e7%9a%843%e5%80%8b%e9%87%8d%e9%bb%9e/" class="thumbnail-link"><img width="300" height="200" src="https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/357092_3618-e1568355776476-300x200.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Read more about the article 自學吉他的 3 個重點" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/357092_3618-e1568355776476-300x200.jpg 300w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/357092_3618-e1568355776476-600x400.jpg 600w, https://tw.scottsu.net/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/357092_3618-e1568355776476-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" title="自學吉他的 3 個重點 3">			<span class="overlay"></span>
</a></div><header class="blog-entry-header clr"><h2 class="blog-entry-title entry-title">
<a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/%e8%87%aa%e5%ad%b8%e5%90%89%e4%bb%96%e7%9a%843%e5%80%8b%e9%87%8d%e9%bb%9e/"  rel="bookmark">自學吉他的 3 個重點</a></h2></header><ul class="meta obem-default clr" aria-label="Post details:"><li class="meta-cat"><span class="screen-reader-text">Post category:</span><i class=" icon-folder" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/category/guitar/" rel="category tag">吉他講座</a></li></ul><div class="blog-entry-summary clr" itemprop="text"><p>
因為現在網路的教學資源真的是太多了，想學都學不完，何必花錢？如果「經濟」是你的主要考量，那我會說ＯＫ，當然自學是最省錢甚至免費的好方法，只要你能知道我們在教學生時會去注意到你們的一些細節，我想你自學吉他應該就會比別人有效率一點。</p></div></div></article></div><div class="oceanwp-pagination clr"><ul class='page-numbers'><li><span aria-current="page" class="page-numbers current">1</span></li><li><a class="page-numbers" href="https://tw.scottsu.net/page/2/">2</a></li><li><a class="page-numbers" href="https://tw.scottsu.net/page/3/">3</a></li><li><a class="page-numbers" href="https://tw.scottsu.net/page/4/">4</a></li><li><span class="page-numbers dots">...</span></li><li><a class="page-numbers" href="https://tw.scottsu.net/page/11/">11</a></li><li><a class="next page-numbers" href="https://tw.scottsu.net/page/2/"><span class="screen-reader-text">Go to the next page</span><i class=" fa fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></i></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main><footer id="footer" class="site-footer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/WPFooter" role="contentinfo"><div id="footer-inner" class="clr"><div id="footer-widgets" class="oceanwp-row clr"><div class="footer-widgets-inner container"><div class="footer-box span_1_of_4 col col-1"><div id="tag_cloud-1" class="footer-widget widget_tag_cloud clr"><h4 class="widget-title">標籤</h4><div class="tagcloud"><a href="https://tw.scottsu.net/tag/%e9%9d%9e%e6%ad%a3%e5%bc%8fdemo/" class="tag-cloud-link tag-link-33 tag-link-position-1" style="font-size: 12.516129032258pt;" aria-label="Demo (4 個項目)">Demo<span class="tag-link-count"> (4)</span></a>
